# Netlify response headers for the web app. No other site may frame it (a framed page could trick a click
# before a wallet prompt); browsers must not guess file types; other sites see only the origin in the referrer.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
